OL,3,AMan convicted of starting Palisades
OL,4,Afire in Los Angeles
OL,5,
OL,6,FRinderknecht, who had pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty, was convicted of two federal
OL,8,Fcharges. He is due to be sentenced on
OL,9,F17 March when he faces between five and
OL,10,F20 years in prison on each charge.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
