OL,3,AZelensky says Putin is a 'killer' after
OL,4,ATrump calls Russian leader a friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fhas labelled Vladimir Putin as a
OL,8,F"killer" in response to Donald Trump
OL,9,Freferring to the Russian leader as his
OL,10,F"friend" in China this week.
OL,12,FSpeaking to CNN, Zelensky said it was
OL,13,Fup to the US president "how to call
OL,14,FPutin" but "for us, he is an enemy...
OL,15,Ffor us, he's a killer".
OL,17,FOn the sidelines of a historic
OL,18,Ftrilateral meeting with Chinese leader
OL,19,FXi Jinping and Putin on Thursday, Trump
OL,20,Fcalled Putin his "friend" and said the
OL,21,Ftwo leaders have had a "great
OL,22,Frelationship for many years".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
